"Congratulations, you rolled successfully. (A roll of {roll}).\n"
"You may now select Roll for Wild Talents."
msgstr ""
"Enhorabuena, has tenido éxito. (Una tirada de {roll}).\n"
"Ahora puedes elegir Tirar talentos salvajes."

